  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the trisection point of any arbitrary double ordinate of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo></math> is"
